# Minimal session for INCURSION_LOF_PROBE (inc-30ps phase 2,
# Creature::LineOfFireProbe, src/Fight.cpp). The probe runs once,
# synchronously, at the very top of Game::Play().
#
# Read by tools/check_line_of_fire.sh, which loads a frozen character
# fixture with INCURSION_LOAD=orc-barbarian-seed1-opt0822 instead of
# generating a character from chargen.keys, then sets INCURSION_LOF_PROBE=1
# and reads the probe's own PASS/FAIL lines out of logs/errors.log. The
# probe builds its own open line (LOFProbeFindLine, src/Fight.cpp), so
# nothing left in this script decides a probe outcome.

SPACE*80
ESC*20

@quit
